{"module":"before-race","voice":"female","duration":465.3,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"Before race: where the fear came from","start":0.0,"end":2.44,"words":[[0.04,0.36],[0.36,0.77],[1.06,1.3],[1.3,1.46],[1.46,1.7],[1.7,2.03],[2.03,2.35]]},{"el":"intro","text":"People often ask why the targeting of Black, Brown and Native people has lasted so long, and whether some forgotten origin explains it.","start":3.24,"end":11.69,"words":[[3.24,3.6],[3.6,3.89],[3.89,4.11],[4.11,4.33],[4.33,4.47],[4.47,4.98],[4.98,5.12],[5.12,5.48],[5.74,6.1],[6.1,6.32],[6.32,6.75],[6.75,7.12],[7.12,7.33],[7.33,7.77],[7.77,7.98],[7.98,8.27],[8.53,8.75],[8.75,9.04],[9.04,9.25],[9.25,9.76],[9.76,10.27],[10.27,10.92],[10.92,11.14]]},{"el":"intro","text":"The record gives a clearer answer: modern race is recent, it was written into law on purpose, and it has been defended by whatever argument was handy, including scripture and science.","start":12.04,"end":23.21,"words":[[12.09,12.23],[12.23,12.58],[12.58,12.86],[12.86,13.0],[13.0,13.42],[13.42,13.77],[14.02,14.37],[14.37,14.65],[14.65,14.79],[14.79,15.28],[15.53,15.67],[15.67,15.88],[15.88,16.23],[16.23,16.51],[16.51,16.65],[16.65,16.79],[16.79,17.21],[17.46,17.67],[17.67,17.81],[17.81,18.02],[18.02,18.23],[18.23,18.79],[18.79,19.0],[19.0,19.42],[19.42,19.98],[19.98,20.19],[20.19,20.61],[20.86,21.42],[21.42,21.98],[21.98,22.19],[22.19,22.68]]},{"el":"h0","text":"The ancient world sorted people differently","start":23.56,"end":26.43,"words":[[23.61,23.78],[23.78,24.37],[24.37,24.71],[24.71,25.13],[25.13,25.55],[25.55,26.31]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Slavery is ancient, but for most of history it was not based on skin color.","start":27.13,"end":32.01,"words":[[27.17,27.71],[27.71,27.84],[27.84,28.38],[28.61,28.82],[28.82,28.95],[28.95,29.29],[29.29,29.42],[29.42,29.89],[29.89,30.03],[30.03,30.23],[30.23,30.43],[30.43,30.77],[30.77,30.9],[30.9,31.17],[31.17,31.51]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Greeks, Romans, Egyptians, Africans, Arabs and Europeans enslaved people taken in war, sold for debt, or born to enslaved mothers, and enslaved people came from every region.","start":32.36,"end":45.3,"words":[[32.41,32.86],[33.13,33.73],[33.99,34.74],[35.0,35.68],[35.94,36.32],[36.32,36.54],[36.54,37.29],[37.29,37.89],[37.89,38.27],[38.27,38.72],[38.72,38.87],[38.87,39.09],[39.35,39.73],[39.73,39.88],[39.88,40.18],[40.44,40.52],[40.52,40.74],[40.74,40.89],[40.89,41.49],[41.49,41.94],[42.2,42.43],[42.43,43.03],[43.03,43.4],[43.4,43.7],[43.7,44.0],[44.0,44.3],[44.3,44.83]]},{"el":"s0","text":"The English word slave itself comes from Slav, because so many Eastern Europeans were enslaved in the Middle Ages.","start":45.65,"end":52.44,"words":[[45.69,45.82],[45.82,46.23],[46.23,46.44],[46.44,46.78],[46.78,47.19],[47.19,47.46],[47.46,47.74],[47.74,48.08],[48.32,48.66],[48.66,48.87],[48.87,49.14],[49.14,49.48],[49.48,50.16],[50.16,50.3],[50.3,50.85],[50.85,50.98],[50.98,51.12],[51.12,51.46],[51.46,51.94]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Historian Frank Snowden showed that Greek and Roman writers described Africans with curiosity and sometimes admiration, without the idea of a fixed racial ranking.","start":52.79,"end":63.88,"words":[[52.83,53.51],[53.51,53.89],[53.89,54.41],[54.41,54.72],[54.72,54.94],[54.94,55.24],[55.24,55.47],[55.47,55.92],[55.92,56.38],[56.38,57.06],[57.06,57.66],[57.66,57.89],[57.89,58.79],[58.79,59.02],[59.02,59.62],[59.62,60.45],[60.72,61.17],[61.17,61.32],[61.32,61.7],[61.7,61.85],[61.85,62.0],[62.0,62.38],[62.38,62.83],[62.83,63.36]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Race was written into law (1452–1705)","start":64.78,"end":69.12,"words":[[64.84,65.17],[65.17,65.42],[65.42,65.83],[65.83,66.16],[66.16,66.32],[66.32,68.64]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The idea that some people are naturally meant to be owned was spelled out step by step:","start":69.82,"end":74.56,"words":[[69.86,70.0],[70.0,70.34],[70.34,70.55],[70.55,70.75],[70.75,71.1],[71.1,71.17],[71.17,71.79],[71.79,72.06],[72.06,72.2],[72.2,72.34],[72.34,72.61],[72.61,72.82],[72.82,73.16],[73.16,73.37],[73.37,73.65],[73.65,73.85],[73.85,74.2]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1452–1455: Pope Nicholas V's bulls Dum Diversas and Romanus Pontifex authorized Portugal's king to conquer “Saracens and pagans” and reduce them to perpetual slavery.","start":74.91,"end":88.66,"words":[[74.94,77.34],[77.63,77.96],[77.96,78.54],[78.54,78.79],[78.79,79.12],[79.12,79.37],[79.37,80.03],[80.03,80.28],[80.28,80.94],[80.94,81.77],[81.77,82.43],[82.43,83.17],[83.17,83.42],[83.42,83.59],[83.59,84.0],[84.0,84.66],[84.66,84.91],[84.91,85.49],[85.49,85.74],[85.74,86.24],[86.24,86.49],[86.49,86.65],[86.65,87.4],[87.4,88.14]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Portugal's African slave trade grew under them.","start":89.01,"end":92.08,"words":[[89.01,89.65],[89.65,90.14],[90.14,90.49],[90.49,90.84],[90.84,91.05],[91.05,91.33],[91.33,91.62]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1493: Inter caetera gave Spain lands “discovered” in the Americas.","start":92.43,"end":97.51,"words":[[92.48,93.55],[93.79,94.08],[94.08,94.5],[94.5,94.79],[94.79,95.14],[95.14,95.5],[95.5,96.07],[96.07,96.21],[96.21,96.35],[96.35,96.99]]},{"el":"s1","text":"These bulls became the Doctrine of Discovery, which the U.S. Supreme Court adopted in Johnson v. M'Intosh (1823) to deny Native nations full ownership of their land.","start":97.86,"end":109.08,"words":[[97.91,98.13],[98.13,98.41],[98.41,98.83],[98.83,98.98],[98.98,99.47],[99.47,99.61],[99.61,100.32],[100.57,100.85],[100.85,100.99],[100.99,101.35],[101.7,102.13],[102.13,102.34],[102.34,102.83],[102.83,102.98],[102.98,103.47],[103.47,103.68],[104.04,104.53],[104.53,105.53],[105.77,105.91],[105.91,106.27],[106.27,106.69],[106.69,107.19],[107.19,107.4],[107.4,107.9],[107.9,108.04],[108.04,108.25],[108.25,108.61]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The Vatican repudiated the doctrine in 2023.","start":109.43,"end":112.75,"words":[[109.48,109.6],[109.6,110.0],[110.0,110.76],[110.76,110.88],[110.88,111.29],[111.29,111.41],[111.41,112.34]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The Supreme Court has not.","start":113.1,"end":114.89,"words":[[113.15,113.29],[113.29,113.71],[113.71,113.92],[113.92,114.13],[114.13,114.41]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1662: Virginia ruled that a child follows the condition of the mother, so children of enslaved women, including children of their enslavers, were born enslaved.","start":115.24,"end":125.76,"words":[[115.24,116.31],[116.55,117.08],[117.08,117.35],[117.35,117.55],[117.55,117.69],[117.69,118.09],[118.09,118.49],[118.49,118.63],[118.63,119.16],[119.16,119.3],[119.3,119.43],[119.43,119.77],[120.0,120.2],[120.2,120.74],[120.74,120.87],[120.87,121.41],[121.41,121.81],[122.05,122.58],[122.58,123.12],[123.12,123.25],[123.25,123.45],[123.45,124.13],[124.36,124.49],[124.49,124.7],[124.7,125.3]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1667–1705: Virginia declared that baptism does not free a slave (1667), that killing an enslaved person during “correction” was not a felony (1669), banned interracial marriage (1691), and gathered everything into the 1705 slave codes.","start":126.11,"end":147.86,"words":[[126.16,128.97],[129.25,129.89],[129.89,130.45],[130.45,130.69],[130.69,131.33],[131.33,131.57],[131.57,131.82],[131.82,132.06],[132.06,132.22],[132.22,132.62],[132.62,134.14],[134.42,134.66],[134.66,135.07],[135.07,135.23],[135.23,135.87],[135.87,136.27],[136.27,136.83],[136.83,137.47],[137.47,137.71],[137.71,137.96],[137.96,138.12],[138.12,138.6],[138.6,140.04],[140.32,140.64],[140.64,141.45],[141.45,141.93],[141.93,143.29],[143.57,143.81],[143.81,144.22],[144.22,144.78],[144.78,145.1],[145.1,145.26],[145.26,146.38],[146.38,146.78],[146.78,147.27]]},{"el":"s1","text":"France's Code Noir (1685) did the same for its colonies.","start":148.21,"end":152.88,"words":[[148.22,148.75],[148.75,149.05],[149.05,149.27],[149.27,150.4],[150.66,150.88],[150.88,151.03],[151.03,151.33],[151.33,151.48],[151.48,151.71],[151.71,152.31]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Dividing people who might unite","start":153.78,"end":155.81,"words":[[153.83,154.41],[154.41,154.76],[154.76,154.91],[154.91,155.2],[155.2,155.63]]},{"el":"s2","text":"In 1676, Bacon's Rebellion brought white indentured servants and enslaved Africans together in an armed revolt against Virginia's government.","start":156.51,"end":165.48,"words":[[156.56,156.69],[156.69,157.94],[158.17,158.63],[158.63,159.16],[159.16,159.42],[159.42,159.68],[159.68,160.27],[160.27,160.73],[160.73,160.93],[160.93,161.45],[161.45,161.98],[161.98,162.37],[162.37,162.5],[162.5,162.64],[162.64,162.83],[162.83,163.29],[163.29,163.69],[163.69,164.28],[164.28,164.93]]},{"el":"s2","text":"In the decades that followed, Virginia's laws gave poor white people small privileges (freedom dues, the right to bear arms, the right to strike a Black person) while taking rights away from all Black people, free or enslaved.","start":165.83,"end":180.26,"words":[[165.88,166.03],[166.03,166.18],[166.18,166.72],[166.72,166.95],[166.95,167.49],[167.76,168.45],[168.45,168.68],[168.68,168.99],[168.99,169.22],[169.22,169.53],[169.53,169.91],[169.91,170.22],[170.22,171.07],[171.07,171.53],[171.53,171.91],[172.18,172.34],[172.34,172.64],[172.64,172.8],[172.8,173.03],[173.03,173.34],[173.61,173.76],[173.76,174.07],[174.07,174.22],[174.22,174.68],[174.68,174.84],[174.84,175.14],[175.14,175.53],[175.8,176.11],[176.11,176.57],[176.57,176.95],[176.95,177.26],[177.26,177.57],[177.57,177.72],[177.72,178.03],[178.03,178.49],[178.76,178.99],[178.99,179.07],[179.07,179.76]]},{"el":"s2","text":"That the laws changed is documented.","start":180.61,"end":183.09,"words":[[180.66,180.85],[180.85,180.99],[180.99,181.18],[181.18,181.71],[181.71,181.84],[181.84,182.63]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Historian Edmund Morgan argued that the elite used race on purpose to keep poor white and Black people from uniting again.","start":183.44,"end":190.34,"words":[[183.49,184.13],[184.13,184.55],[184.55,184.91],[184.91,185.26],[185.26,185.47],[185.47,185.61],[185.61,185.9],[185.9,186.18],[186.18,186.46],[186.46,186.61],[186.61,186.96],[186.96,187.1],[187.1,187.31],[187.31,187.53],[187.53,187.81],[187.81,188.02],[188.02,188.3],[188.3,188.66],[188.66,188.94],[188.94,189.51],[189.51,189.86]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Others think the shift had more to do with the falling cost of enslaved Africans compared with English servants.","start":190.69,"end":196.63,"words":[[190.74,191.01],[191.01,191.28],[191.28,191.42],[191.42,191.69],[191.69,191.9],[191.9,192.03],[192.03,192.17],[192.17,192.31],[192.31,192.51],[192.51,192.65],[192.65,192.99],[192.99,193.26],[193.26,193.4],[193.4,193.94],[193.94,194.49],[194.49,194.96],[194.96,195.17],[195.17,195.58],[195.58,196.12]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Most agree the effect was the same.","start":196.98,"end":199.15,"words":[[197.03,197.36],[197.36,197.62],[197.62,197.75],[197.75,198.08],[198.08,198.28],[198.28,198.41],[198.41,198.74]]},{"el":"h3","text":"The practice came first, the ideas followed","start":200.05,"end":203.49,"words":[[200.09,200.28],[200.28,200.93],[200.93,201.31],[201.31,201.77],[202.1,202.29],[202.29,202.85],[202.85,203.41]]},{"el":"s3","text":"In 1944 the Trinidadian historian Eric Williams wrote that “slavery was not born of racism: rather, racism was the consequence of slavery.”","start":204.19,"end":213.61,"words":[[204.24,204.38],[204.38,205.27],[205.27,205.4],[205.4,206.22],[206.22,206.84],[206.84,207.11],[207.11,207.59],[207.59,207.87],[207.87,208.07],[208.07,208.62],[208.62,208.82],[208.82,209.03],[209.03,209.24],[209.24,209.37],[209.37,209.99],[210.23,210.57],[210.81,211.36],[211.36,211.56],[211.56,211.7],[211.7,212.38],[212.38,212.52],[212.52,213.14]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Ibram X. Kendi's Stamped from the Beginning (2016) traces the same pattern over five centuries: racist ideas were developed to defend policies that were already profitable.","start":213.96,"end":225.73,"words":[[214.01,214.37],[214.37,214.66],[215.02,215.46],[215.46,215.89],[215.89,216.18],[216.18,216.33],[216.33,216.84],[216.84,217.78],[218.03,218.54],[218.54,218.69],[218.69,218.98],[218.98,219.34],[219.34,219.63],[219.63,219.92],[219.92,220.65],[220.9,221.41],[221.41,221.84],[221.84,221.99],[221.99,222.57],[222.57,222.72],[222.72,223.15],[223.15,223.66],[223.66,223.88],[223.88,224.02],[224.02,224.46],[224.46,225.26]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Thomas Jefferson, who enslaved more than 600 people over his life, offered Black inferiority “as a suspicion only” in his Notes on the State of Virginia (1785).","start":226.08,"end":237.69,"words":[[226.1,226.47],[226.47,227.14],[227.4,227.55],[227.55,228.15],[228.15,228.3],[228.3,228.52],[228.52,229.34],[229.34,229.72],[229.72,230.01],[230.01,230.24],[230.24,230.61],[230.87,231.17],[231.17,231.47],[231.47,232.44],[232.44,232.59],[232.59,232.74],[232.74,233.33],[233.33,233.71],[233.71,233.86],[233.86,234.08],[234.08,234.45],[234.45,234.6],[234.6,234.75],[234.75,235.12],[235.12,235.27],[235.27,235.87],[235.87,237.14]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Within decades, “scientists” were measuring skulls to prove it (see the module on science).","start":238.04,"end":243.54,"words":[[238.09,238.45],[238.45,239.03],[239.28,240.01],[240.01,240.15],[240.15,240.66],[240.66,241.02],[241.02,241.16],[241.16,241.45],[241.45,241.6],[241.6,241.74],[241.74,241.89],[241.89,242.32],[242.32,242.47],[242.47,242.97]]},{"el":"h4","text":"What the fear was really about","start":244.44,"end":246.26,"words":[[244.49,244.72],[244.72,244.88],[244.88,245.11],[245.11,245.34],[245.34,245.72],[245.72,246.11]]},{"el":"s4","text":"The fear was real.","start":246.96,"end":248.35,"words":[[247.0,247.14],[247.14,247.34],[247.34,247.54],[247.54,247.87]]},{"el":"s4","text":"It was fear of revolt, of revenge, and of losing power at the ballot box:","start":248.7,"end":254.23,"words":[[248.75,248.91],[248.91,249.15],[249.15,249.39],[249.39,249.55],[249.55,250.19],[250.47,250.63],[250.63,251.27],[251.55,251.8],[251.8,251.96],[251.96,252.36],[252.36,252.68],[252.68,252.84],[252.84,253.0],[253.0,253.4],[253.4,253.8]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Haiti, 1791–1804: enslaved people overthrew French rule and founded the first free Black republic.","start":254.58,"end":263.02,"words":[[254.63,255.09],[255.36,257.57],[257.84,258.45],[258.45,258.84],[258.84,259.37],[259.37,259.83],[259.83,260.06],[260.06,260.29],[260.29,260.82],[260.82,260.97],[260.97,261.28],[261.28,261.51],[261.51,261.81],[261.81,262.5]]},{"el":"s4","text":"France later forced Haiti to pay 150 million francs (reduced to 90 million) for its own freedom, a debt Haiti paid off over about 120 years.","start":263.37,"end":273.42,"words":[[263.4,263.73],[263.73,264.07],[264.07,264.33],[264.33,264.66],[264.66,264.79],[264.79,264.99],[264.99,266.12],[266.12,266.51],[266.51,266.91],[266.91,267.37],[267.37,267.51],[267.51,267.9],[267.9,268.3],[268.53,268.66],[268.66,268.86],[268.86,269.06],[269.06,269.52],[269.75,269.89],[269.89,270.09],[270.09,270.42],[270.42,270.68],[270.68,270.81],[270.81,271.08],[271.08,271.41],[271.41,272.6],[272.6,272.93]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Nat Turner's rebellion, 1831: afterward, Virginia and other states tightened bans on teaching Black people to read and on Black preachers and gatherings.","start":273.77,"end":284.47,"words":[[273.83,274.06],[274.06,274.45],[274.45,275.15],[275.42,276.43],[276.7,277.32],[277.59,278.21],[278.21,278.44],[278.44,278.68],[278.68,279.14],[279.14,279.68],[279.68,279.99],[279.99,280.15],[280.15,280.62],[280.62,280.93],[280.93,281.31],[281.31,281.47],[281.47,281.7],[281.7,281.93],[281.93,282.09],[282.09,282.4],[282.4,282.94],[282.94,283.18],[283.18,283.87]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Reconstruction, 1867–1877: Black men voted and held office, and South Carolina's lower house had a Black majority.","start":284.82,"end":295.25,"words":[[284.87,285.94],[286.21,288.96],[289.23,289.54],[289.54,289.77],[289.77,290.22],[290.22,290.45],[290.45,290.76],[290.76,291.14],[291.41,291.64],[291.64,291.94],[291.94,292.71],[292.71,293.02],[293.02,293.32],[293.32,293.55],[293.55,293.7],[293.7,294.01],[294.01,294.77]]},{"el":"s4","text":"White-supremacist violence ended it, including the 1898 coup in Wilmington, North Carolina, where an elected biracial government was overthrown by force.","start":295.6,"end":306.36,"words":[[295.65,296.71],[296.71,297.28],[297.28,297.63],[297.63,297.85],[298.09,298.66],[298.66,298.8],[298.8,299.87],[299.87,300.08],[300.08,300.22],[300.22,300.93],[301.18,301.39],[301.39,302.1],[302.35,302.56],[302.56,302.71],[302.71,303.2],[303.2,303.84],[303.84,304.48],[304.48,304.69],[304.69,305.33],[305.33,305.54],[305.54,305.83]]},{"el":"s4","text":"“Replacement”: Madison Grant's The Passing of the Great Race (1916) warned that white Americans were being outbred.","start":306.71,"end":313.87,"words":[[306.75,307.54],[307.77,308.23],[308.23,308.63],[308.63,308.76],[308.76,309.09],[309.09,309.22],[309.22,309.36],[309.36,309.68],[309.68,309.95],[309.95,310.87],[311.1,311.37],[311.37,311.57],[311.57,311.83],[311.83,312.42],[312.42,312.56],[312.56,312.89],[312.89,313.41]]},{"el":"s4","text":"It helped pass the 1924 immigration quotas.","start":314.22,"end":317.96,"words":[[314.3,314.44],[314.44,314.79],[314.79,315.0],[315.0,315.14],[315.14,316.19],[316.19,316.89],[316.89,317.45]]},{"el":"s4","text":"The same fear, renamed the “Great Replacement,” was cited by the killers in El Paso (2019) and Buffalo (2022).","start":318.31,"end":326.75,"words":[[318.36,318.51],[318.51,318.8],[318.8,319.09],[319.34,319.85],[319.85,320.0],[320.0,320.36],[320.36,321.24],[321.24,321.46],[321.46,321.89],[321.89,322.11],[322.11,322.26],[322.26,322.62],[322.62,322.77],[322.77,322.91],[322.91,323.28],[323.28,324.22],[324.48,324.7],[324.7,325.21],[325.21,326.3]]},{"el":"h5","text":"How scripture was used, and misused","start":327.65,"end":330.74,"words":[[327.69,327.96],[327.96,328.69],[328.69,328.96],[328.96,329.41],[329.73,330.0],[330.0,330.63]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The “Curse of Ham.”","start":331.44,"end":332.59,"words":[[331.49,331.61],[331.61,331.8],[331.8,331.92],[331.92,332.17]]},{"el":"s5","text":"In Genesis 9:20–27, Noah curses Canaan, Ham's son, to be a servant.","start":332.94,"end":339.14,"words":[[332.99,333.13],[333.13,333.69],[333.69,335.36],[335.61,335.88],[335.88,336.23],[336.23,336.65],[336.9,337.18],[337.18,337.45],[337.7,337.84],[337.84,337.98],[337.98,338.12],[338.12,338.61]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The text says nothing about skin color or Africa.","start":339.49,"end":342.44,"words":[[339.55,339.68],[339.68,340.02],[340.02,340.22],[340.22,340.56],[340.56,340.89],[340.89,341.16],[341.16,341.43],[341.43,341.5],[341.5,341.97]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Linking the curse to dark skin came much later and was spread by interpreters across several traditions.","start":342.79,"end":348.63,"words":[[342.84,343.24],[343.24,343.38],[343.38,343.58],[343.58,343.71],[343.71,343.92],[343.92,344.19],[344.19,344.46],[344.46,344.73],[344.73,345.06],[345.06,345.27],[345.27,345.47],[345.47,345.8],[345.8,346.01],[346.01,346.68],[346.68,347.02],[347.02,347.42],[347.42,348.1]]},{"el":"s5","text":"By the 1800s it was a standard pro-slavery argument in American pulpits.","start":348.98,"end":353.91,"words":[[349.03,349.22],[349.22,349.34],[349.34,350.16],[350.16,350.29],[350.29,350.47],[350.47,350.6],[350.6,351.04],[351.04,351.8],[351.8,352.3],[352.3,352.42],[352.42,352.93],[352.93,353.43]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The “Slave Bible.”","start":354.26,"end":355.81,"words":[[354.32,354.46],[354.46,354.82],[354.82,355.31]]},{"el":"s5","text":"In 1807 a British missionary society printed Select Parts of the Holy Bible, for the Use of the Negro Slaves.","start":356.16,"end":364.62,"words":[[356.21,356.37],[356.37,357.33],[357.33,357.49],[357.49,357.97],[357.97,358.61],[358.61,359.25],[359.25,359.81],[359.81,360.29],[360.29,360.61],[360.61,360.77],[360.77,360.93],[360.93,361.33],[361.33,361.89],[362.17,362.33],[362.33,362.49],[362.49,362.73],[362.73,362.89],[362.89,363.05],[363.05,363.54],[363.54,364.1]]},{"el":"s5","text":"It cut most of the Old Testament, including the Exodus story of freedom from slavery, and kept passages like “Servants, be obedient to them that are your masters.”","start":364.97,"end":375.89,"words":[[365.02,365.17],[365.17,365.39],[365.39,365.77],[365.77,365.92],[365.92,366.07],[366.07,366.37],[366.37,367.12],[367.39,367.99],[367.99,368.14],[368.14,368.66],[368.66,369.04],[369.04,369.19],[369.19,369.64],[369.64,369.94],[369.94,370.62],[370.88,371.1],[371.1,371.4],[371.4,372.01],[372.01,372.31],[372.31,372.91],[373.17,373.32],[373.32,374.0],[374.0,374.15],[374.15,374.37],[374.37,374.6],[374.6,374.67],[374.67,374.82],[374.82,375.35]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Scripture was also the strongest weapon against slavery: enslaved people sang of Moses and Exodus, and abolitionists from Frederick Douglass to the Black church built their case on it.","start":376.24,"end":387.61,"words":[[376.28,376.86],[376.86,377.07],[377.07,377.43],[377.43,377.57],[377.57,378.22],[378.22,378.58],[378.58,379.01],[379.01,379.65],[379.9,380.47],[380.47,380.83],[380.83,381.05],[381.05,381.19],[381.19,381.62],[381.62,381.84],[381.84,382.41],[382.66,382.87],[382.87,383.73],[383.73,384.02],[384.02,384.59],[384.59,385.02],[385.02,385.17],[385.17,385.31],[385.31,385.6],[385.6,385.95],[385.95,386.24],[386.24,386.46],[386.46,386.74],[386.74,386.89],[386.89,387.1]]},{"el":"h6","text":"The Book of Enoch and modern race myths","start":388.51,"end":390.95,"words":[[388.56,388.73],[388.73,388.97],[388.97,389.14],[389.14,389.47],[389.47,389.71],[389.71,390.13],[390.13,390.46],[390.46,390.79]]},{"el":"s6","text":"1 Enoch is an ancient Jewish book that is part of the Bible of the Ethiopian Orthodox Church; fragments were found among the Dead Sea Scrolls, and the Letter of Jude (verses 14–15) quotes it.","start":391.65,"end":404.44,"words":[[391.7,391.93],[391.93,392.24],[392.24,392.39],[392.39,392.54],[392.54,393.08],[393.08,393.46],[393.46,393.69],[393.69,393.92],[393.92,394.08],[394.08,394.31],[394.31,394.46],[394.46,394.62],[394.62,395.08],[395.08,395.23],[395.23,395.38],[395.38,396.15],[396.15,396.69],[396.69,397.15],[397.42,398.11],[398.11,398.26],[398.26,398.65],[398.65,398.95],[398.95,399.11],[399.11,399.34],[399.34,399.49],[399.49,400.1],[400.37,400.6],[400.6,400.76],[400.76,401.06],[401.06,401.22],[401.22,401.52],[401.52,401.91],[401.91,402.91],[403.18,403.64],[403.64,403.87]]},{"el":"s6","text":"It tells how angels called the Watchers came to earth, taught forbidden knowledge, and fathered giants (the Nephilim of Genesis 6).","start":404.79,"end":413.02,"words":[[404.85,405.0],[405.0,405.3],[405.3,405.53],[405.53,406.13],[406.13,406.43],[406.43,406.59],[406.59,407.04],[407.04,407.34],[407.34,407.49],[407.49,407.72],[407.98,408.21],[408.21,408.73],[408.73,409.26],[409.52,409.75],[409.75,410.13],[410.13,410.73],[410.73,410.88],[410.88,411.41],[411.41,411.56],[411.56,412.16],[412.16,412.54]]},{"el":"s6","text":"It contains no teaching about race.","start":413.37,"end":415.66,"words":[[413.42,413.55],[413.55,414.05],[414.05,414.24],[414.24,414.62],[414.62,414.93],[414.93,415.25]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Modern movements have still built race stories on Genesis and Enoch.","start":416.01,"end":420.35,"words":[[416.06,416.43],[416.43,417.03],[417.03,417.25],[417.25,417.55],[417.55,417.85],[417.85,418.14],[418.14,418.59],[418.59,418.74],[418.74,419.33],[419.33,419.56],[419.56,419.93]]},{"el":"s6","text":"We describe them so you can recognize them, not because they are true:","start":420.7,"end":424.81,"words":[[420.74,420.88],[420.88,421.44],[421.44,421.64],[421.64,421.85],[421.85,421.99],[421.99,422.2],[422.2,422.82],[422.82,423.1],[423.34,423.55],[423.55,423.9],[423.9,424.11],[424.11,424.17],[424.17,424.45]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Christian Identity “two-seedline” theology, a white-supremacist doctrine claiming Jews and people of color descend from the serpent or from “pre-Adamic” races.","start":425.16,"end":435.43,"words":[[425.21,425.81],[425.81,426.49],[426.49,427.17],[427.17,427.92],[428.18,428.33],[428.33,429.46],[429.46,429.99],[429.99,430.51],[430.51,430.81],[430.81,431.04],[431.04,431.42],[431.42,431.57],[431.57,431.87],[431.87,432.32],[432.32,432.62],[432.62,432.77],[432.77,433.22],[433.22,433.3],[433.3,433.6],[433.6,434.35],[434.35,434.87]]},{"el":"s6","text":"The Nation of Islam's story of Yakub, which teaches that a scientist named Yakub created white people thousands of years ago.","start":435.78,"end":443.46,"words":[[435.83,435.96],[435.96,436.38],[436.38,436.52],[436.52,436.93],[436.93,437.28],[437.28,437.42],[437.42,437.83],[438.08,438.35],[438.35,438.77],[438.77,438.98],[438.98,439.12],[439.12,439.74],[439.74,440.08],[440.08,440.43],[440.43,441.05],[441.05,441.33],[441.33,441.68],[441.68,442.23],[442.23,442.37],[442.37,442.65],[442.65,442.99]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Some Hebrew Israelite groups teach that Black, Hispanic and Native Americans are the true Israelites and that others are cursed.","start":443.81,"end":452.25,"words":[[443.86,444.11],[444.11,444.52],[444.52,445.26],[445.26,445.67],[445.67,446.0],[446.0,446.25],[446.25,446.66],[446.94,447.6],[447.6,447.85],[447.85,448.34],[448.34,449.08],[449.08,449.16],[449.16,449.33],[449.33,449.58],[449.58,450.4],[450.4,450.64],[450.64,450.89],[450.89,451.22],[451.22,451.3],[451.3,451.71]]},{"el":"s6","text":"These stories mirror each other: each claims race is ancient, fixed and cosmic.","start":452.6,"end":458.04,"words":[[452.65,452.88],[452.88,453.33],[453.33,453.64],[453.64,453.86],[453.86,454.17],[454.43,454.66],[454.66,455.11],[455.11,455.42],[455.42,455.57],[455.57,456.17],[456.44,456.82],[456.82,457.04],[457.04,457.57]]},{"el":"s6","text":"The historical record shows the opposite: race is recent, made by people, and can be unmade.","start":458.39,"end":464.39,"words":[[458.44,458.57],[458.57,459.25],[459.25,459.59],[459.59,459.86],[459.86,459.99],[459.99,460.46],[460.7,460.97],[460.97,461.11],[461.11,461.58],[461.82,462.09],[462.09,462.29],[462.29,462.69],[462.93,463.13],[463.13,463.34],[463.34,463.47],[463.47,463.94]]}]}